---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withSiteNameEn } from '../../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title={withSiteNameEn('Cookie Settings')} description="Manage optional Google Analytics and local consent storage." noHeader>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="backlink" href="/en/">→ Back to main guide</a>
      <h1>Cookie Settings</h1>
      <p>Last updated: 20 October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <article class="legal-wrap">
    <p>We use cookies and similar local browser technologies only for the site’s basic operation, to remember your consent, and — with your permission — to understand aggregate traffic. This non-profit site has no active personalised advertising.</p>

    <div class="cookie-card">
      <div class="cookie-row">
        <div><h3>Essential storage</h3><p>Needed for basic site function, security, and remembering your consent state. It cannot be turned off because it keeps the rest of your preferences in effect.</p></div>
        <strong>Always active</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cookie-card">
      <div class="cookie-row">
        <div><h3>Analytics cookie</h3><p>Helps understand aggregate usage, popular pages, and general traffic trends via Google Analytics. It is off by default and activates only with your consent.</p></div>
        <label class="switch"><input id="analytics" type="checkbox" /> Enable</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cookie-card">
      <div class="cookie-row">
        <div><h3>Preference storage</h3><p>Can remember your local site choices. This site uses a single Urdu language and a fixed visual theme, so this category is limited in use.</p></div>
        <label class="switch"><input id="preferences" type="checkbox" /> Enable</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cookie-card">
      <div class="cookie-row">
        <div><h3>Marketing cookie</h3><p>For personalised ads, commercial retargeting, or campaign measurement. We do not use this category.</p></div>
        <strong>Disabled</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>About Google Maps</h2>
    <p>In the main guide, Google Maps is embedded as an external map. The map loads from Google’s own servers and may have its own cookie/privacy policy. Turning off our analytics consent does not necessarily disable the external map frame’s own technical behaviour; if you do not want it loaded at all, use your browser’s third-party protections; scrolling away does not prevent a map already loaded from connecting.</p>

    <h2>Managing consent</h2>
    <p>You can return to this page anytime to change your choice. “Reject all” immediately disables this site’s analytics. We try to save the choice; if saving fails, the message explains its scope.</p>
    <div class="cookie-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="save-preferences" type="button">Save preferences</button>
      <button class="btn" style="border-color:#c9cfc9;background:white;color:#123d33" id="reject-all" type="button">Reject all</button>
    </div>
    <p class="cookie-status" id="cookie-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </article>


</BaseLayout>
